      "date": "2026-01-29T00:00:00.000Z",
      "title": "Rose Merc Limited announced that it expects to receive INR 0.924998 million in funding",
      "body": "Rose Merc Limited announced private placement to offer, issue and allot 41,111 Convertible Equity Warrants at an issue price of INR 22.5 for gross proceeds of INR 924,997.5 on January 29, 2026. The transaction includes participation from Kirti Chunilal Savla for 11,111 warrants, Vijay Acharya for 30,000  warrants. Each Warrant would be convertible into, or exchangeable, at an exercise price of INR 67.5 at an option within a maximum period of 18 months from the date of allotment of Warrants into equivalent number of fully paid-up equity share of face value of INR 10 each of the Company. An amount equivalent to at least 25% of the warrant issue price shall be payable upfront along with the application and the balance 75% shall be payable by the Proposed Allottee(s) of warrants on the exercis",
      "keyDevTypeId": "83",
      "source_url": null,
      "raw_subtype": "EventActivity"
